<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA BEAT ARGENTINA 3-2.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA BEAT ARGENTINA 3-2.</headline>
<dateline>MAR DEL PLATA, Argentina 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia</p>
<p>beat Argentina 3-2 (halftime 1-1) in a friendly soccer</p>
<p>international on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Yugoslavia - Milinko Drulovic (22nd minute), Dejan</p>
<p>Govedarica (53rd), Jovicic (77th)</p>
<p>Argentina - Juan Esnaider (43nd, penalty), Hugo Morales</p>
<p>(61st)</p>
<p>Attendance: 19,000</p>
